# Forest enters untapped, the library shuffled; Bot2's library is not searched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Grow from the Ashes
Tropical Island
Llanowar Elves
Plains
Tropical Island
Llanowar Elves
Forest x10

